    <guid isPermaLink="false">6902b7637f1b08483a52f505</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_gbE6CLe9XknSYEzdqXNjwrZZm.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期书目</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《图书馆里的魔女侦探》皇甫涟</span></p><span></span><p><span>《青之毒》亚戈</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期成员</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>MC：煎蛋 / 吗喽（吗喽闲翻书主播）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：皇甫涟 亚戈</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>你将听到：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 故事简介及闲谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a>《青之毒》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a>《图书馆的魔女侦探》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a> 作者自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 亚戈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 皇甫涟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 精彩部分推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> &nbsp;亚戈：解答篇的解密设计，诡计，叙述以及对传统武侠的比拟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">20:44</a> 皇甫涟：故事的整体框架，以及通过书籍特征给出的解答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 一只吗喽：两本书沉浸感很强。《魔女侦探》数理逻辑和对魔女身份的推理。《青之毒》一句话反转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 煎蛋：《青之毒》逻辑链及伏笔回收，推理的切入点。《图书馆的魔女侦探》中《答案之书》和逻辑流的结合，角色鲜活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> 作品创作深度讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a>《青之毒》唐不疑和青煞是否是一体两面？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 《图书馆的魔女侦探》辛夕星和魔女之间的关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a> 作品角色名字以及和笔名相关的逸闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 最早接触推理的契机以及和社刊相关的二三事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">43:27</a> 在创作过程中有没有擅长的类型或者有什么创作偏好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 故事的结尾设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3132">52:12</a> 武功不高的人在武侠中应该如何生存？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3313">55:13</a> 武侠和推理之间是什么关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3458">57:38</a> 日常之谜如何设计的精彩？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a> 两位作者未来的创作方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3732">1:02:12</a> 关于推理本土化的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4114">1:08:34</a> 作者推荐时间！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>一些你可能想知道的链接👇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/doulist/154859499/?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doulist/154859499/?dt_dapp=1"><span>🔗「异本正经电台」提及的小说</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://b23.tv/XQ3Q6qb" data-url="https://b23.tv/XQ3Q6qb"><span>🔗「异本正经电台」bilibili主页</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>制作团队</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>声音设计、剪辑 / 零零 五蠹</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面 / 阿四 五蠹</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营 / 电台全体成员</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>推理不止，不止推理｜异本正经STUDIO出品；异本正经是一档业余播客（大家都是为爱发电💡纯爱好无收入），很需要大家的支持（可点赞打赏），或者有意愿加入我们帮忙剪辑和管理也🉑️。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>1、商务合作请邮件至 milkbox22@163.com 或者添加微信 cutemilkbox；</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2、如果喜欢请订阅、转发、评论和点赞节目，加听友群可微信添加摆渡人“YBZJ220411”，与主播和群友交流，我们不定期会有各种互动、抽奖活动。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
